 "answer_verbatim": "For a **local shop with strong customer feedback**, I’d start with **Big Brand Tire & Service** at **3687 Old Santa Rita Rd**. Its listing shows **4.7/5 from 701 reviews**, with customers praising quick service and fair prices. It sells and installs tires, and is a good first call for a quote.\n\nFor a **well-reviewed independent shop**, consider **Seever & Sons Tire** in Pleasanton; its Yelp listing shows **4.8/5 from 531 reviews**. It may be especially appealing if you value a local shop and personal service.\n\n**My pick for installation:** Big Brand is the clearest bet based on the larger volume of local reviews. Seever & Sons is a strong alternative. I wouldn’t call any shop definitively “the best” from ratings alone—ask about appointment availability, the full installed price (including balancing, disposal, and any fees), and alignment if needed.",
